Package: pla8ma-window-decorator
Architecture: any
Depends: kwin-wayland | kwin-x11, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: flat KWin window decoration that follows the Plasma color scheme
 Pla8ma Window Decorator is a native KDecoration3 window decoration for KWin
 (Plasma 6). It draws a flat, single colored frame with square corners and
 caption buttons attached to the top edge.
 .
 By default the frame uses the accent color of the active KDE color scheme
 and changes along with it. The frame color, intensity, inactive color, title
 text color, title alignment, button size and shadow can be changed in System
 Settings.
